2026-09-24T15:51:11.2632027Z   mirror: |
2026-09-24T15:51:11.2632390Z     SSTATE_MIRRORS = "file://.* http://sstate.yoctoproject.org/all/PATH;downloadfilename=PATH"
2026-09-24T15:51:11.2632719Z   ccache: |
